                            <property name="can-focus">False</property>
                            <property name="tooltip-text" translatable="yes">Friction: a constant resistance whenever the wheel moves, the same at any speed, like a dry bearing. Games use it for the steering rack's own drag and for the front tyres scrubbing at low speed. On the G29 this is rendered by the driver (the wheel has no native friction).</property>
